<https://cair-nepal.org/heritagegraph/RitualType> <https://cair-nepal.org/heritagegraph/design_note> "RitualType currently mixes three orthogonal axes: worship-frequency (NityaPuja/NaimittikaPuja/KamyaPuja), ritual form (Homa/Jatra/MaskedPerformance), and lifecycle (InstallationRitual/ReturningRitual). Consider splitting into RitualFrequency + RitualForm. Also: Circumambulation/ProcessionalMovement/ProcessionRitual/RelicTour overlap with RitualEvent.route_places/start_place/end_place/route_description -- pick one canonical mechanism for moving rituals." .
